{
  "$comment": "The rig family every authored body in this project animates on (spec 139). Tripo-named, because that is the naming spec the auto-rig returns and a mixamo-named rig is refused by the retarget -- the two are a choice between clip libraries, and a game needs the clips. It was called `pig` until the fox joined it, which is exactly the wrong shape of name for a contract shared by every species: the fox is a member and is not a pig. bindPose was measured off pig_a_pose_full.glb, the first rig of the family, and is never rewritten -- from here it is what the next rig is checked against by compareToFamily, because the one clip library below animates all of them. canonicalHeight is DEFAULT_CANONICAL_HEIGHT from src/units/canonical-height.ts.",
